program	literal_suffix_type_mismatch_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot assign `UInt16` to variable of type `Int8`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot assign `UInt16` to variable of type `Int8`"
log	"  --> examples/literal_suffix_type_mismatch_error.saw:8:5"
log	"    |"
log	" 8 |     let x: Int8 = 5u16"
log	"    |     ^"
log	"   hint: write the conversion: `as Int8` panics out of range, `Int8.from(...)` answers `None`, `Int8.from(truncating: ...)` keeps the low bits"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
